// Position matrix (design 235), grid 3 "Graph shapes" — row: self-import.
// A module importing itself compiles and runs clean: the degenerate
// length-one cycle has no name it does not already have, so there is
// nothing for `_topological_sort` to get wrong (unlike the 2/3-cycle rows,
// DF-232e, which involve genuinely distinct modules needing each other's
// names before either is checked).
//
// EXPECT: success
// EXPECT-OUTPUT: 1

import modules.graphself.a

func main() {
    print("{a.alpha()}")
}
